extends ./layout

block title
  | Redis Job Queue Unavailable

block content
  | The Redis system became unreachable at 
  strong #{downSince}
  | . Campaigns currently running may not be paused automatically.
  br
  br

  if jobCount > 0
    strong 🚨 #{jobCount} campaign(s) at risk:
    br
    br

    table(border="1", cellpadding="8", cellspacing="0", style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-size: 14px;")
      thead
        tr(style="background: #fff2f2;")
          th(style="text-align: left;") Job ID
          th(style="text-align: left;") Campaign
          th(style="text-align: left;") Campaign ID
          th(style="text-align: left;") Action
          th(style="text-align: left;") Scheduled At
          th(style="text-align: left;") Status
      tbody
        each job in jobs
          tr
            td= job.id
            td= job.campaignName
            td= job.campaignId
            td= job.action
            td= job.scheduledAt
            td(style="color: " + (job.status.includes('OVERDUE') ? '#d32f2f' : '#333'))= job.status

    br
    br
    strong Action required:
    br
    | These campaigns have pending pause jobs that may not execute.
    br
    | If Redis does not recover before the scheduled pause time, 
    strong you must manually pause them in Amazon Ads Console.
    br
    br
    | When Redis restarts, any missed pause jobs will be automatically 
    | cleaned up and will NOT execute (to prevent double-pausing).

  else
    | No campaigns are currently in an active slot. All pending jobs are scheduled starts.

  br